                      "parameters":  {
                                         "content":  "## ðŸŽ¯ Lead Qualifier â€“ hot / warm / cold\nYour website form or ad POSTs a new lead â†’ Claude qualifies it (hot = ready to buy) â†’ every lead saved to Google Sheets â†’ hot leads ping you on WhatsApp so you can call them first.\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. **Webhook**: send `{ name, phone, email, source, message }` from your form / Zapier / Meta Lead Ads to the Production URL.\n2. **Claude Qualify**: add your Anthropic API key credential.\n3. **Save to Sheet**: tab `Leads` with columns Timestamp, Name, Phone, Email, Source, Message, Status, Reason. Paste the sheet ID.\n4. **WhatsApp Owner Alert**: WhatsApp Business Cloud API credential, your Phone Number ID, and YOUR number as recipient.\n5. Activate.\n\n---\nPart of **MAP â€“ 12 AI agents** (Kaamchor AI).",
